  "body": "Positioned in one of Orewa’s fast-growing communities, it presents an outstanding opportunity to secure a premium freehold section with resource consent already approved — ready for you to bring your vision to life.\r\n\r\nSet on an elevated 239sqm site, this section enjoys a peaceful setting surrounded by quality modern homes, offering both lifestyle appeal and strong future value.\r\n\r\nProperty Key features:\r\n* Freehold title – 239sqm (more or less)\r\n* Elevated site with great positioning\r\n* Resource Consent approved – save time and cost\r\n* Located in a high-growth development area\r\n* Surrounded by quality, newly built homes\r\n* Quiet, family-friendly neighbourhood\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation & lifestyle\r\n* Minutes to beautiful Orewa Beach\r\n* Close to Silverdale Mall, shops, and cafés\r\n* Easy access to motorway connections\r\n* Popular coastal lifestyle with strong community growth\r\n\r\nThis is a rare chance to secure a ready-to-build section in a sought-after coastal location. Whether you're planning your dream home or looking for a smart investment in a rapidly developing area, this property ticks all the boxes. Sections in this location are in high demand. Get in touch today for more information or to secure this fantastic opportunity\r\n\r\nLooking to buy in Strathmill? Visit the Team Steenberg Sales Office daily between 12:00pm–2:00pm and let one of our team show you through the homes that suit you.",
